      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRADLE OF JAZZ (6) has come along in leaps and bounds this prep and is full of confidence. Gets in light with the 3kg claim after dismissing a similar field here two weeks ago. Can repeat the dose. GURU WARRIOR (2) was good fresh but found Listed company a touch too sharp last time. Reunites with Holder and will appreciate the rise in trip. GIGGENBACH (7) is knocking on the door and continues to finish full of running. Gets in well with the 2kg claim and is sure to be warming into it late. JANDAMI (4) has been a touch less effective in his last two but his peaks measure up and he can rediscover himself here. LIKE A TIGER (3) has improved sharply in his last two and meets COJ 2kg better after being beaten 3L last time. He'll push forward again and give them something to catch.",
